{
    "title": "Domino Classic Online",
    "description": "Domino is one of the most popular board games in the world. With awesome graphics and animations and an intuitive user interface, play this classic board game online and challenge players from all over the world. Super fun and easy to play. Also perfect for developing logical thinking and enhancing memory.\r\n\r\n<b>GET RID OF ALL YOUR DOMINOES</b>\r\nTo connect the pieces/tiles together, the number of pips at the end of each of the tiles must match. The goal of the game is to get rid of all your dominoes before your opponent. Easy, right? You just need to match the tile you have with one of the ends already on the board. Set up a strategy in the Domino board game and choose your moves carefully.\r\n\r\n<b>3 GAME MODES</b>\r\nThe player with the highest double domino starts the game.\r\nPlay until one player has no dominoes or until all players are blocked.\r\n\r\nDRAW DOMINOES\r\nAll dominoes can only connect to 2 other dominos (no spinner).\r\nIf you are stuck, you can pick a domino that hasn't been distributed yet from the boneyard.\r\nPlayers start the following rounds alternatively.\r\nThe first player with 100 points wins the game.\r\n\r\nBLOCK DOMINOES\r\nAll dominoes can only connect to 2 other dominoes (no spinner).\r\nIf you are stuck, you have to pass until a move is possible.\r\nPlayers start the following rounds alternatively.\r\nThe first player with 100 points wins the game.\r\n\r\nALL FIVES DOMINOES\r\nThe first double becomes the Spinner. The Spinner can be connected to 4 other dominoes.\r\nWhen you set a tile, the 2, 3, or 4 ends of the board are summed up. If this total is a multiple of five (5, 10, 15, 20, 25, 30, or 35 points), you immediately score that number of points.\r\nIf you are stuck, you can pick a domino from the boneyard.\r\nThe winner of the last round starts the next round with any tile.\r\nFirst player with 200 points wins the game.\r\n\r\n<b>CHALLENGE YOUR FRIENDS IN DOMINO</b>\r\nPlay against real players from all over the world or create a private room and invite a friend to play. You can also play offline and test your playing skills against our challenging AI. Show how good and smart you are!\r\n\r\n<b>CLIMB THE LEADERBOARD</b>\r\nTrack your stats and improve your performance. You will love this game and you won't stop playing until you are number 1. Compete for the top.\r\n\r\n<b>CUSTOMIZE AVATAR AND THEMES</b>\r\nClean and user-friendly design to ensure you can enjoy and be focused solely on the game without any fuss or unwanted interruptions.\r\nA great selection of board design and domino tiles themes for you to choose from. Customize your avatar and choose a country. Play to win coins and unlock them all.\r\n\r\n<b>TEST YOUR SKILLS</b>\r\nHave fun and sharpen your mind playing different game modes. Learn all the tricks and strategies. With lots of practice and a little bit of luck, you will be unstoppable.\r\n\r\nAre you a Dominoes master?\r\nGo ahead, look no further. Download and start playing now!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Domino is one of the most popular board games in the world. With awesome graphics and animations and an intuitive user interface, play this classic board game online and challenge players from all over the world. Super fun and easy to play. Also perfect for developing logical thinking and enhancing memory.<br><br><b>GET RID OF ALL YOUR DOMINOES</b><br>To connect the pieces/tiles together, the number of pips at the end of each of the tiles must match. The goal of the game is to get rid of all your dominoes before your opponent. Easy, right? You just need to match the tile you have with one of the ends already on the board. Set up a strategy in the Domino board game and choose your moves carefully.<br><br><b>3 GAME MODES</b><br>The player with the highest double domino starts the game.<br>Play until one player has no dominoes or until all players are blocked.<br><br>DRAW DOMINOES<br>All dominoes can only connect to 2 other dominos (no spinner).<br>If you are stuck, you can pick a domino that hasn&#39;t been distributed yet from the boneyard.<br>Players start the following rounds alternatively.<br>The first player with 100 points wins the game.<br><br>BLOCK DOMINOES<br>All dominoes can only connect to 2 other dominoes (no spinner).<br>If you are stuck, you have to pass until a move is possible.<br>Players start the following rounds alternatively.<br>The first player with 100 points wins the game.<br><br>ALL FIVES DOMINOES<br>The first double becomes the Spinner. The Spinner can be connected to 4 other dominoes.<br>When you set a tile, the 2, 3, or 4 ends of the board are summed up. If this total is a multiple of five (5, 10, 15, 20, 25, 30, or 35 points), you immediately score that number of points.<br>If you are stuck, you can pick a domino from the boneyard.<br>The winner of the last round starts the next round with any tile.<br>First player with 200 points wins the game.<br><br><b>CHALLENGE YOUR FRIENDS IN DOMINO</b><br>Play against real players from all over the world or create a private room and invite a friend to play. You can also play offline and test your playing skills against our challenging AI. Show how good and smart you are!<br><br><b>CLIMB THE LEADERBOARD</b><br>Track your stats and improve your performance. You will love this game and you won&#39;t stop playing until you are number 1. Compete for the top.<br><br><b>CUSTOMIZE AVATAR AND THEMES</b><br>Clean and user-friendly design to ensure you can enjoy and be focused solely on the game without any fuss or unwanted interruptions.<br>A great selection of board design and domino tiles themes for you to choose from. Customize your avatar and choose a country. Play to win coins and unlock them all.<br><br><b>TEST YOUR SKILLS</b><br>Have fun and sharpen your mind playing different game modes. Learn all the tricks and strategies. With lots of practice and a little bit of luck, you will be unstoppable.<br><br>Are you a Dominoes master?<br>Go ahead, look no further. Download and start playing now!",
